-       Not mirrored in the `soundness` umbrella's `calibrations` package, so it is imported as
-       `import tasseomancy.calibrations.exponentialCalibration`; `Calibration[Double]
-       (Calibration.Policy.Exponential(2.0))` makes one with another curvature.
-   entry .tightCalibration   linear positions over exactly the data's extent, with no padding
